<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ to offer NZ$100 mln of govt bonds in tender.</title>
<headline>RBNZ to offer NZ$100 mln of govt bonds in tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday it would offer NZ$100 million of February 2001 government bonds at its next tender on May 15.</p>
<p>The bonds have an eight percent coupon.</p>
<p>Bids close 11.30 a.m. (2330 GMT), results will be announced at 1 p.m. and settlement is May 20.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
